# mihd@rtlq.ru: IMAP to local Maildir synchronization.
# The password stays in gopass; only its entry name is stored here.
IMAPAccount rtlq
Host mail.rtlq.ru
Port 993
User mihd@rtlq.ru
PassCmd "gopass show --password mail.rtlq.ru/mihd"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore rtlq-remote
Account rtlq

MaildirStore rtlq-local
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/rtlq/
SubFolders Maildir++

Channel rtlq
Far :rtlq-remote:
Near :rtlq-local:
Patterns INBOX *
Create Near
Remove None
Expunge None
Sync All
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

# danilamihailov@icloud.com: iCloud IMAP connection.
IMAPAccount icloud
Host imap.mail.me.com
Port 993
User danilamihailov
PassCmd "gopass show --password apple-app-pwd/mail"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore icloud-remote
Account icloud

MaildirStore icloud-local
